TWEAK_NAME="Firewall: one iptables-restore call"
TWEAK_RISK="high"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Installs a ready-made WCP ruleset and inserts a fast path into /jci/scripts/jci-fw.sh, so the Wi-Fi firewall is restored in one call instead of one iptables invocation per rule. Needs OPENCMU_WCP_RULES and OPENCMU_FW_ANCHOR; it never guesses where the fast path goes."
